docs {
  # Responses
  
  HTTP/2 has **no reason phrase**: only `:status` goes on the wire. Bruno fills `statusText` from Node's `STATUS_CODES`, so the UI and `res.getStatusText()` should look exactly as they do on HTTP/1.1. Response headers must never include the `:status` pseudo-header.
}
